# Keep LF line endings in every checkout, including on Windows.
#
# Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true, which turns LF into CRLF on
# checkout, and `git archive` applies the same conversion. Shell scripts
# that reach the Ubuntu server with CRLF fail there with
# "$'\r': command not found". That covers scripts/*.sh and scripts/camlctl
# pushed by provision_vps.sh from Git Bash, and anything copied over by
# hand. CI's operator-windows job checks this on a real Windows checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never convert.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.parquet binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
